    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered <strong>Loremaster</strong>.</p><hr><p>When you perform the <strong>Study</strong> action during a conflict, you may examine the <strong>profiles</strong> of <strong>all enemies</strong> you can see. If you do, you perform a single <strong>【INS + INS】</strong> Open Check and apply the Result <strong>separately</strong> to each enemy.</p><p>However, if you have acquired the @UUID[Compendium.projectfu.skills.Item.J5KbrSiczxizbdM3]{Flash of Insight} Skill, this Check <strong>cannot</strong> trigger it.</p>",
